    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Sized Rescue Squad is a fast paced 2D platformer inspired by games like &quot;Jill of the Jungle&quot; and &quot;Choplifter&quot;. You play as Wendy Aettridge, a young cargo plane pilot who is thrust into an international conflict when her plane is shot down by an evil cult, hell bent on world domination. She is exposed to a mysteries ooze that allows her to transform into a powerful giant! As a new super hero she runs out into the conflict zone to rescue civilians captured by the cult for experimentation. Crack open the POW camps, grab the prisoners and get them back to base sefely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.poster.avif?t=1727625508\" width=568 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.webm?t=1727625508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.mp4?t=1727625508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Game Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around the battle field stomping enemy tanks, dodging missiles, climbing up buildings and snatching the little civilians out of danger to deliver them back to safety at home base. On some missions a fellow soldier will help Wendy by infiltrating the enemy facilities, venturing where she can't in her giant form. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Retro Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the early days of PC gaming with lovingly drawn pixel graphics, made in the style of early 90's VGA games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Sized Rescue Squad is a fast paced 2D platformer inspired by games like &quot;Jill of the Jungle&quot; and &quot;Choplifter&quot;. You play as Wendy Aettridge, a young cargo plane pilot who is thrust into an international conflict when her plane is shot down by an evil cult, hell bent on world domination. She is exposed to a mysteries ooze that allows her to transform into a powerful giant! As a new super hero she runs out into the conflict zone to rescue civilians captured by the cult for experimentation. Crack open the POW camps, grab the prisoners and get them back to base sefely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.poster.avif?t=1727625508\" width=568 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.webm?t=1727625508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937110/extras/42be250f79e2e018be3b23c1c09044e8.mp4?t=1727625508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Game Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around the battle field stomping enemy tanks, dodging missiles, climbing up buildings and snatching the little civilians out of danger to deliver them back to safety at home base. On some missions a fellow soldier will help Wendy by infiltrating the enemy facilities, venturing where she can't in her giant form. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Great Retro Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the early days of PC gaming with lovingly drawn pixel graphics, made in the style of early 90's VGA games.</p>",
